<title>UK: NYMEX expands London office, boosts metal marketing.</title>
<headline>NYMEX expands London office, boosts metal marketing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Mercantile Exchange (NYMEX) is planning to expand its international metals marketing in London, and has hired a metals marketing associate.</p>
<p>In a release, Nymex said Simon Biddle, who previously worked as metals sales manager at Lehman Brothers, will fill this position.</p>
<p>Nymex President Patrick Thompson said &quot;I am looking forward to the benefits that having a strong presence in this key marketing centre for gold, silver, copper and platinum group metals will bring to our international effort.&quot;</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
</text>
